    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Sundarbans National Park was declared a UNESCO World Heritage Site in 1987 and a Ramsar Site in 2019.",
        "Singalila National Park is the highest national park in West Bengal and is famous for Red Panda conservation.",
        "Nor'westers (locally known as Kalbaisakhi) bring localized thunderstorms to West Bengal during late spring and summer."
      ],
      "id": "nl111f0"
